{"thread":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3miawjaazyc24","cid":"bafyreigzi4yf37scbjdf2joihjtbccwbt76jm2nhxxe3vxe66q5zpaqxly","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-03-30T05:28:20.270Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreiadi6eycscrix465lt7j7xffftc4kdlf3dpjpahvslecm3d7mfxea","uri":"at://did:plc:ygyvxq2zj37swjm7fe3ylmuc/app.bsky.feed.post/3miauzwml6s2p"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreiauxgyxtkxuk6rgonxiam6ukfzq736cak2ramkoyrtu3t56vdzwq4","uri":"at://did:plc:qc6xzgctorfsm35w6i3vdebx/app.bsky.feed.post/3miabmrzhh22m"}},"text":"Per the other thread all Anthropic holdings are in the foundation, dedicated to charity.\n\nThe “AI is a scam” narrative was annoying last year. It is itself the scam among the people who continue to peddle it. Great changes are coming and people need to stop burying their heads in the sand."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":3,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":3,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-03-30T05:28:20.553Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:ygyvxq2zj37swjm7fe3ylmuc/app.bsky.feed.post/3miauzwml6s2p","cid":"bafyreiadi6eycscrix465lt7j7xffftc4kdlf3dpjpahvslecm3d7mfxea","author":{"did":"did:plc:ygyvxq2zj37swjm7fe3ylmuc","handle":"andymorrish.bsky.social","displayName":"Andy Morrish","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ygyvxq2zj37swjm7fe3ylmuc/bafkreigp4wnygnxschz725vswz2ehdm2rjo2ry2askppbl4sj6a3nhclyq","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2024-11-12T03:08:36.007Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-03-30T05:01:53.103Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreigkuzaes73yzsa2fy2xgmgoygnxsgpgscah7r2pec3f7xjwxeztcm","uri":"at://did:plc:7h5okj6yhcq6twydcu7trhv2/app.bsky.feed.post/3miasdjvzl22h"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreiauxgyxtkxuk6rgonxiam6ukfzq736cak2ramkoyrtu3t56vdzwq4","uri":"at://did:plc:qc6xzgctorfsm35w6i3vdebx/app.bsky.feed.post/3miabmrzhh22m"}},"text":"The guy who seems the most angry on this thread is the guy who stands to lose the most money when the AI bubble pops. (And he’s desperately trying to discredit the facts and the people who present them.)"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":2,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-03-30T05:01:54.456Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:7h5okj6yhcq6twydcu7trhv2/app.bsky.feed.post/3miasdjvzl22h","cid":"bafyreigkuzaes73yzsa2fy2xgmgoygnxsgpgscah7r2pec3f7xjwxeztcm","author":{"did":"did:plc:7h5okj6yhcq6twydcu7trhv2","handle":"pjkaz.bsky.social","displayName":"Peter K Needs to Catch Up On Content","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:7h5okj6yhcq6twydcu7trhv2/bafkreieypwyg7yhpsim3dh2yvfd56iqqy72jpysionumpcikopvl2ze5n4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[{"src":"did:plc:7h5okj6yhcq6twydcu7trhv2","uri":"at://did:plc:7h5okj6yhcq6twydcu7trhv2/app.bsky.actor.profile/self","cid":"bafyreihjck4znfrbelcacpocz7jhu5izulm7ebiwl7baidefe6ytb4zd24","val":"!no-unauthenticated","cts":"2024-05-07T16:11:26.567Z"}],"createdAt":"2024-05-07T16:11:26.435Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-03-30T04:13:34.101Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreibsgq36n72bqmwchi4rd